# TODO: Translation updated at 2025-12-03 08:54

# game/script day13.rpy:21
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_c0159408:

    # p "I have no doubt he just wants to make my last days as miserable as he possibly can."
    p "我毫不怀疑，他只是想尽可能地让我在船上的最后日子过得痛苦不堪"

# game/script day13.rpy:25
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_22cb3400:

    # "You drag the back of your paw across your brow, smearing in oil, before begrudgingly returning to scrub out the stains of food from the bowl."
    "你用爪子背面擦过额头，抹开上面的油污，随后不情愿地继续刷洗碗中的食物污渍"

# game/script day13.rpy:35
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_69a60799:

    # "It only means that the stink of old grease clings even harder to your fur."
    "这只会让陈年油脂的臭味更顽固地附着在你的毛发上"

# game/script day13.rpy:37
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_b4c096ad:

    # "Your knees already ache from crouching on the hard boards. Every time you dip the sponge, a sour rot wafts from the bucket and mingles with the salt air until you're not sure which is worse."
    "由于一直蹲在坚硬的木板上，你的膝盖已经开始疼痛，每当你将海绵浸入桶内，一股酸腐气味便会飘出，并与咸涩的空气混合在一起，让你难以分辨哪种气味更难闻"

# game/script day13.rpy:39
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_3617011c:

    # "The only good thing about it is the cool salt water in the bucket you are using."
    "唯一好受点的就只有桶里冰凉的海水"

# game/script day13.rpy:41
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_a554b6f5:

    # "No matter how dirty it is by now."
    "无论它现在有多脏"

# game/script day13.rpy:43
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_80ccef76:

    # "You glance toward the brighter part of the deck, where light spills through the cargo grate, and other crew mates talk and laugh with {i}their{/i} hands clean."
    "你看向甲板明亮的区域，光线从货物格栅透入，其他船员正在交谈欢笑，{i}他们的{/i}双手十分干净"

# game/script day13.rpy:45
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_d321a6b1:

    # "Hardly does it matter that they have probably all done this before. They're not the ones scraping dried stew from other people's bowls."
    "他们以前干过又怎样？现在刷碗刮残羹的只有你一个"

# game/script day13.rpy:47
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_c3bed4fa:

    # "It's you."
    "是你"

# game/script day13.rpy:56
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_d1408810:

    # j "You're not the only one back here cleaning, are you though?"
    j "你不是唯一一个在后面清洗的人，对吧？"

# game/script day13.rpy:58
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_29c32535:

    # "Julian leans against the hull, still chewing, and responds between bites of his lunch."
    "Julian靠在船板上，边嚼着午饭边应着话"

# game/script day13.rpy:62
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_bd72287e:

    # j "It's just typical landsman work. You're new, at the bottom of the pole and so you get assigned the stuff nobody else wants to do."
    j "给旱鸭子干的杂活，因为你是新来的，处于最底层"

# game/script day13.rpy:66
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_3f944280:

    # "He lifts another wooden spoon full of lobscouse, pausing just long enough to finish his thought before eating."
    "他举起又一满勺炖菜，稍作停顿，把话说完后才吃下"

# game/script day13.rpy:68
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_a92ac6e8:

    # j "Easy for everyone else to pawn it off to you if you've got no status to say no."
    j "你没地位，不敢说不，别人自然把脏活全推给你"

# game/script day13.rpy:77
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_f4714797:

    # "Wolf appears entirely unaffected by the exchange. He dutifully inspects the wooden spoon, turning it in the dim light to check for leftover grime."
    "Wolf似乎完全没有受到这段对话的影响，他尽职尽责地检查木勺，在昏暗的光线下翻转它，查看是否有残留的污垢"

# game/script day13.rpy:79
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_1195c6bb:

    # "Today the sunshine of this area has returned, but even with the hatches opened, the corner you have been placed in still struggles to be lit thoroughly."
    "今天天放晴了，可就算舱口开着，你待的角落还是亮不起来"

# game/script day13.rpy:81
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_421d3e4c:

    # "Even the stiff breeze that drafts through the ship can't lift your mood."
    "连船上刮过的劲风，都提不起你的兴致"

# game/script day13.rpy:85
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_37c77b82:

    # w "Someone needs to do it."
    w "总得有人做这些"

# game/script day13.rpy:87
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_bad8cf1f:

    # w "Nor should this be any worse than what you've done back home."
    w "这应该不比你以前在家干的活更糟"

# game/script day13.rpy:91
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_9e55c883:

    # p "Back home, I didn't have someone barking orders just to watch me squirm."
    p "在家那会儿，可没人天天吼着命令我，就为看我难受"

# game/script day13.rpy:93
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_83946ac4:

    # j "I agree with the grump. As a farmer's boy you're hardly new to getting your hands dirty."
    j "我同意这闷货的话，你本就是田舍郎，不怕把手弄脏"

# game/script day13.rpy:102
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_82da42bb:

    # "You exhale sharply."
    "你重重地呼出一口气"

# game/script day13.rpy:104
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_b714bba5:

    # p "I've had worse, yes."
    p "是啊，我经历过更糟的"

# game/script day13.rpy:106
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_f9772f3b:

    # p "But, it's the principle of being made to do it."
    p "但这是被迫去做的原则问题"

# game/script day13.rpy:108
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_ce370bc4:

    # p "Bilge and deck swabbing yesterday, now this."
    p "昨天是污水和甲板，现在又是这个"

# game/script day13.rpy:112
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_3d0cc577:

    # j "Next might be caulking the bilge seam. That's just part of that sailor's dream of yours."
    j "接下来搞不好要去堵船底缝了，这就是你心心念念的水手梦"

# game/script day13.rpy:116
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_bfd7a27e:

    # j "Funny how the old salt stories never mention this part, huh?"
    j "有趣的是那些老水手的故事里从未提及过这一部分吧？"

# game/script day13.rpy:118
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_643a71bb:

    # "You concede with but a sigh that they rarely did."
    "你只得以一声叹息承认了，确实很少被提及"

# game/script day13.rpy:122
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_626da361:

    # "The tales you heard always began with open sails cutting across azure waves, hammocks swaying under starlight, maybe a tavern brawl or two—dangerous, but exciting."
    "你听过的那些传说，开篇总是扬帆破浪，碧海青天，吊床在星光下晃悠，偶尔酒馆打架——危险，却够刺激"

# game/script day13.rpy:124
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_bcb4ddda:

    # "Not this."
    "但不是这样"

# game/script day13.rpy:126
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_6ce718c3:

    # "Not squatting in shadows, elbow-deep in someone else's filth, with the stink of rotting food clinging to your whiskers."
    "不是蹲在阴影里，手臂深陷在他人的污物之中，腐坏食物的臭味黏附在你的胡须上"

# game/script day13.rpy:130
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_18727f99:

    # "Frustration boils over and the spoon you are washing becomes the victim of your outburst as you slam it into the grimy water."
    "挫败感骤然爆发，你正在清洗的勺子成为发泄对象，被猛地扔进浑浊的水中"

# game/script day13.rpy:134
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_7f891068:

    # p "Why are you not helping?!"
    p "你为什么不帮忙？！"

# game/script day13.rpy:138
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_cb47ad63:

    # "Julian chews, swallows, then answers."
    "Julian嚼完咽下，开口答道"

# game/script day13.rpy:140
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_d08d6ec0:

    # j "I'm eating."
    j "我在吃饭"

# game/script day13.rpy:142
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_220c46b0:

    # p "Eat faster then."
    p "那就吃快点"

# game/script day13.rpy:146
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_83acd4bf:

    # j "I want to savor it."
    j "我想好好品尝"

# game/script day13.rpy:148
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_939f0c30:

    # j "Bandile put in a lot of effort. A lot of effort that I don't want to go to waste by scarfing it down like a pig."
    j "Bandile很用心做的，我不想像猪一样狼吞虎咽，糟蹋了他的心意"

# game/script day13.rpy:150
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_282fe8e2:

    # p "It's just lobscouse."
    p "只是水手炖菜而已"

# game/script day13.rpy:154
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_e0e687f2:

    # j "And I want to savor my lobscouse."
    j "而我想要细细品尝我的水手炖菜"

# game/script day13.rpy:156
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_0c3c87ef:

    # j "Might be the only warm thing I get all day."
    j "毕竟这可能是我一整天接触到唯一的热乎东西"

# game/script day13.rpy:158
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_bf7ce6e1:

    # p "Maybe if you would help us you'd warm up, too!"
    p "也许你要是帮我们，你也能暖和起来！"

# game/script day13.rpy:160
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_e505e464:

    # w "Let him have his lunch..."
    w "让他先吃完午饭吧……"

# game/script day13.rpy:169
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_2b7e8841:

    # "You snap your head toward Wolf."
    "你猛地转头看向Wolf"

# game/script day13.rpy:171
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_3d0f239b:

    # p "We're doing {i}his{/i} work for him."
    p "我们在替他干{i}他的{/i}活"

# game/script day13.rpy:175
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_a0e14f32:

    # w "Would it change anything about what you're doing if he helped right now?"
    w "如果他现在帮忙，会改变你正在做的事吗？"

# game/script day13.rpy:177
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_368710d0:

    # "Your nostrils flare. Frustration prickles up through your limbs as the two conspire agains you."
    "你气得鼻孔微张，怒火直窜四肢，这两人又联手挤兑你"

# game/script day13.rpy:179
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_60d4b6ef:

    # "Thankfully you notice."
    "幸好你察觉到了"

# game/script day13.rpy:181
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_5a0477a4:

    # "Breathe in."
    "吸气"

# game/script day13.rpy:183
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_19edcd68:

    # "And out."
    "呼气"

# game/script day13.rpy:185
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_875ce35a:

    # p ". . ."
    p ". . ."

# game/script day13.rpy:187
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_80d1baa2:

    # p "No,{w} but we'd be done more quickly with his help."
    p "不会，{w}但如果有他帮忙，我们能更快做完"

# game/script day13.rpy:189
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_c4b18f7a:

    # j "And once we're done, we'd just get tasked with something else."
    j "等干完这些，还有别的活儿等着我们"

# game/script day13.rpy:191
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_b4e04e70:

    # "You don't like that they're right. Or that you're forgetting the times you've arrived late to the work yourself."
    "你讨厌他们说得没错，更讨厌自己竟忘了也曾屡次迟到误工"

# game/script day13.rpy:201
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_aa608ee5:

    # "You set the spoon aside and pick up another bowl from a pile that feels no smaller than when you started."
    "你把勺子放到一边，从一堆碗中拿起另一个碗，那堆碗的数量并不比你开始时更少"

# game/script day13.rpy:203
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_15cfab1f:

    # "The one you grab has clearly been left to dry for far too long..."
    "你拿的那个显然因为放得太久，已经干透了……"

# game/script day13.rpy:207
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_74ee5540:

    # "Rather than scrub right away, you drop it into the bucket, hoping a soak will loosen it up. Then you reach for the next."
    "你没直接刷，把碗丢进桶里先泡着，指望能泡软点，接着又拿起下一个"

# game/script day13.rpy:211
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_9b62daa4:

    # j "You want a bite? Then you're helping me finish it more quickly."
    j "想吃？那就帮我快点干完"

# game/script day13.rpy:220
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_a473a0e7:

    # "You glance up. Julian holds out a spoonful. Casual, but not without care."
    "你抬头一看，Julian递来一勺炖菜，动作随意，却并非无心"

# game/script day13.rpy:222
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_b33c7aff:

    # "You hesitate—not because of the food. Because of the gesture."
    "你顿了顿，不是因为吃的，是因为他这份心意"

# game/script day13.rpy:224
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_0a76dc61:

    # "You remember why you like him."
    "你想起了为什么喜欢他"

# game/script day13.rpy:226
translate chinese day13_leaveroute_cleaning_5f3bfb05:

    # p "No, you eat it."
    p "不，你吃吧"

# game/script day13.rpy:252
translate chinese day13_frustration_22c3cf7c:

    # p "My bad. Just frustrations boiling over."
    p "我的错，我只是挫败感涌上心头"

# game/script day13.rpy:254
translate chinese day13_frustration_ad5179a6:

    # j "Right."
    j "好吧"

# game/script day13.rpy:256
translate chinese day13_frustration_ac68ee19:

    # p "I mean it."
    p "我是认真的"

# game/script day13.rpy:260
translate chinese day13_frustration_9232d133:

    # j "And I appreciate it."
    j "我领情了"

# game/script day13.rpy:262
translate chinese day13_frustration_a979d7ef:

    # "You wonder if he truly does, but a faint smile forms on his lips."
    "你不确定他是不是真的这么想，但他嘴角还是轻轻扬了一下"

# game/script day13.rpy:264
translate chinese day13_frustration_9dc75819:

    # j "I'm done in a moment."
    j "我马上就吃完"

# game/script day13.rpy:266
translate chinese day13_frustration_b3ce4747:

    # "It's not long before you hear the spoon scrape up the last remnants of Julian's lobscouse from the bowl."
    "没过一会儿，勺子刮干净碗底的声音传来，Julian吃完了"

# game/script day13.rpy:272
translate chinese day13_frustration_086de87c:

    # "Julian lets out a whistle, then rises from the crate and circles behind you."
    "Julian吹了一声口哨，然后从板条箱上站起来，绕到你身后"

# game/script day13.rpy:281
translate chinese day13_frustration_7c31cd0a:

    # "The next thing you see are his arms that stretch over your shoulder, dangling his dishes just above your lap."
    "紧接着，他的胳膊从你肩上伸过来，碗就悬在你腿边"

# game/script day13.rpy:283
translate chinese day13_frustration_50bd17d0:

    # j "You'd be mad at me if I dropped them in your bucket, right?"
    j "如果我把它们丢进你的桶里，你会生我气吧？"

# game/script day13.rpy:285
translate chinese day13_frustration_0d7b6424:

    # "You don't even put in the effort to look up at him."
    "你甚至懒得抬头看他"

# game/script day13.rpy:287
translate chinese day13_frustration_7eefdb59:

    # p "At the very least I'd whack your arm."
    p "我至少会打你的胳膊"

# game/script day13.rpy:289
translate chinese day13_frustration_669ec517:

    # j "Only my arm?"
    j "只是打胳膊么？"

# game/script day13.rpy:291
translate chinese day13_frustration_2fac13d9:

    # p "{i}At the very least.{/i}"
    p "{i}至少{/i}"

# game/script day13.rpy:293
translate chinese day13_frustration_7bcb35e8:

    # p "There is a lot of room for escalation."
    p "提升"

# game/script day13.rpy:295
translate chinese day13_frustration_c570205e:

    # "He chuckles above your head."
    "他在你头顶轻笑"

# game/script day13.rpy:297
translate chinese day13_frustration_e9d8d37e:

    # j "I won't, then. I'm too pretty to die this young."
    j "那我不了，我这么帅，可不能英年早逝"

# game/script day13.rpy:299
translate chinese day13_frustration_0f59c2c4:

    # j "Make some room though, jeez. The way you two are claiming that space feels like you're wanting to plant a flag in it."
    j "不过腾点位置吧，天哪，你们俩占据这块地方的样子，感觉像是想在这儿插上一面旗帜宣示主权"

# game/script day13.rpy:309
translate chinese day13_frustration_f1a209e1:

    # "You shift, making room as Julian settles between you and Wolf."
    "你挪了挪，腾出空间，Julian在你和Wolf之间坐下"

# game/script day13.rpy:313
translate chinese day13_frustration_f0dd0f47:

    # "Once he's finished cleaning his own cutlery, he taps the rim of the bucket with his fingers, scanning the pile with a sigh."
    "他擦完餐具，用手指敲了敲桶边，看着那堆碗叹了口气"

# game/script day13.rpy:326
translate chinese day13_change_f6702295:

    # p "You're right. It wouldn't change anything."
    p "你说得没错，反正都一样"

# game/script day13.rpy:328
translate chinese day13_change_ed0e05d2:

    # p "But I still would prefer it if he'd help."
    p "但我还是想让他帮一把"

# game/script day13.rpy:337
translate chinese day13_change_a13c2c96:

    # p "Rather than sitting there, and watch us work through this pile as if he belongs to the gentlemen."
    p "总好过他就那么坐着，仿佛自己是绅士一样看着我们处理这堆碗碟要好"

# game/script day13.rpy:341
translate chinese day13_change_ea7b86a8:

    # "Julian rolls his eyes and talks around his chewing."
    "Julian翻了个白眼，边嚼边说"

# game/script day13.rpy:343
translate chinese day13_change_fcb8c456:

    # j "Don't soil your breeches, I'm almost done."
    j "别弄脏你的裤子，我快吃完了"

# game/script day13.rpy:345
translate chinese day13_change_34569b99:

    # j "Just stop working until I'm done if you feel so incredibly hard done by..."
    j "如果你觉得这么委屈，那就等我吃完再干……"

# game/script day13.rpy:347
translate chinese day13_change_680c8923:

    # "Wolf sighs—drawn out, clearly exhausted by the bickering."
    "Wolf叹了口气，拖得很长，显然吵得他烦透了"

# game/script day13.rpy:349
translate chinese day13_change_a660f710:

    # "It feels like too long before you hear the scrape of Julian's spoon as he finishes his meal."
    "你感觉过了很长一段时间，才听到Julian吃完饭后勺子刮擦碗的声音"

# game/script day13.rpy:355
translate chinese day13_change_086de87c:

    # "Julian lets out a whistle, then rises from the crate and circles behind you."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:365
translate chinese day13_change_f1a209e1:

    # "You shift, making room as Julian settles between you and Wolf."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:374
translate chinese day13_change_f5630bec:

    # "He begins to help, starting with his own cutlery."
    "他动手帮忙了，先洗着自己的刀叉"

# game/script day13.rpy:377
translate chinese day13_change_28bf3940:

    # "Once he's finished cleaning it, he taps the rim of the bucket with his fingers, scanning the pile with a sigh."
    "他清洗完餐具后，用手指轻敲桶边，看着那堆碗碟叹了口气"

# game/script day13.rpy:385
translate chinese day13_choice_b091e1bd:

    # w "Can you hand me something?"
    w "能递我点什么吗？"

# game/script day13.rpy:389
translate chinese day13_choice_f3584785:

    # j "And what might the fine gentleman desire?"
    j "那么这位尊贵的先生想要什么？"

# game/script day13.rpy:391
translate chinese day13_choice_490aa282:

    # j "We have at our disposal an exquisite array of tools, cutlery, plates, and the like. Only the finest quality, I assure you."
    j "我们有一系列精美的工具，餐具，盘子等物品可供使用，我向你保证，都是品质最好的"

# game/script day13.rpy:393
translate chinese day13_choice_fcadf147:

    # j "Does anything strike the gentleman's fancy?"
    j "有什么能入这位先生的眼吗？"

# game/script day13.rpy:397
translate chinese day13_choice_ecd80991:

    # "Whenever Julian commits to a role, he can so confidently slip into it."
    "每当Julian投入角色，他都能如此自信地融入其中"

# game/script day13.rpy:399
translate chinese day13_choice_35e9e751:

    # "It can be surprisingly entertaining to watch."
    "看着这一切意外地还挺有趣"

# game/script day13.rpy:403
translate chinese day13_choice_77700b4f:

    # "For a fleeting moment, he even looks like he's considering resting a hand on Wolf's shoulder like some overly familiar street vendor."
    "在极短的一瞬间，他看起来像是想要把手放在Wolf的肩膀上，就像一个过分亲昵的街头小贩一样"

# game/script day13.rpy:405
translate chinese day13_choice_01921660:

    # "You've encountered that type often enough."
    "你经常遇到那种类型的人"

# game/script day13.rpy:407
translate chinese day13_choice_f7210f7c:

    # "It reminds you of Mr. Franklin... He ran a small shop selling the fruit of his orchard back in your hometown, and he was every bit the overly familiar kind."
    "这让你想起了Franklin先生，他在家乡经营着一家小店，出售自己果园里的水果，也是那种过分亲切熟络的人"

# game/script day13.rpy:409
translate chinese day13_choice_20133fda:

    # "You have no idea if Julian knows him, but his mannerisms echo the man's quite well."
    "你不知道Julian是否认识他，但他的举止神态和那人如出一辙"

# game/script day13.rpy:411
translate chinese day13_choice_14034569:

    # "He'd probably thrive on a stage—perhaps in one of those plays. Or an opera, even."
    "他或许能在舞台上大放异彩，也许是在某部戏剧里，甚至是在歌剧表演中"

# game/script day13.rpy:418
translate chinese day13_choice_a1222adf:

    # "Though Wolf actually enjoying such a performance is another matter entirely."
    "不过如果Wolf真的会欣赏这类演出，那可就完全是另一码事了"

# game/script day13.rpy:420
translate chinese day13_choice_44f8ec9a:

    # w "Just hand me something. That's all I asked for."
    w "随便递给我点什么就行，我就这点要求"

# game/script day13.rpy:427
translate chinese day13_choice_e7272e4a:

    # j "Very well then, a few bowls for the gent, coming right up."
    j "那好吧，给这位绅士来几个碗，马上就到"

# game/script day13.rpy:435
translate chinese day13_choice_f3210e31:

    # "Julian gathers a small stack of bowls left over from lunch and presents them to Wolf with playful flourish."
    "Julian拿起一叠午餐剩下的碗，用一种开玩笑的夸张姿势递给Wolf"

# game/script day13.rpy:437
translate chinese day13_choice_efb22588:

    # "A flourish, of course, that Wolf ignores entirely—taking the bowls without blinking an eye."
    "当然，Wolf完全无视了那番做作——他眼皮都没眨一下就把碗接了过去"

# game/script day13.rpy:444
translate chinese day13_choice_af35178b:

    # p "You've gotten pretty good at brushing him aside, you know."
    p "你知道的，你已经很擅长把他晾在一边了"

# game/script day13.rpy:446
translate chinese day13_choice_1ab33505:

    # p "He didn't even complain, or try to fight it."
    p "他甚至没有抱怨，也没试图反抗"

# game/script day13.rpy:448
translate chinese day13_choice_c5e1db2c:

    # p "Just gave you the plate."
    p "就把盘子给你了"

# game/script day13.rpy:450
translate chinese day13_choice_ad710912:

    # "Wolf's eyes find you, just barely peeking from underneath his brows."
    "Wolf的目光落在你身上，几乎只是从眉毛下方悄悄看了你一眼"

# game/script day13.rpy:452
translate chinese day13_choice_392a9509:

    # w "I reign through fear."
    w "我依靠恐惧进行统治"

# game/script day13.rpy:459
translate chinese day13_choice_7fe82dd7:

    # j "Hardly."
    j "才怪"

# game/script day13.rpy:461
translate chinese day13_choice_c5c9c0df:

    # j "You threaten, certainly. But never follow through."
    j "你只会威胁，但从不付诸行动"

# game/script day13.rpy:465
translate chinese day13_choice_db2f658b:

    # j "I'm no fool, Wolf-"
    j "我又不是傻子，Wolf——"

# game/script day13.rpy:469
translate chinese day13_choice_1a8a49ea:

    # w "Debatable."
    w "有待商榷"

# game/script day13.rpy:473
translate chinese day13_choice_f8e948a8:

    # j "-I've gambled often enough to sniff out when someone's bluffing."
    j "——我赌得多了，谁在吹牛，一眼就能看穿"

# game/script day13.rpy:475
translate chinese day13_choice_f26faaec:

    # p "I think it's more a case of not wanting to get into trouble. Trust me Julian, I sense that if he had the opportunity to escape your presence he would."
    p "我认为这更多是因为他不想惹上麻烦，相信我，Julian，我感觉只要有机会，他就会避开你"

# game/script day13.rpy:482
translate chinese day13_choice_1c14bd9e:

    # w "For the last time."
    w "最后再说一次"

# game/script day13.rpy:484
translate chinese day13_choice_0112c4c5:

    # w "I won't be leaving this ship."
    w "我不会离开这艘船"

# game/script day13.rpy:486
translate chinese day13_choice_179cb692:

    # p "I haven't said anything."
    p "我什么也没说"

# game/script day13.rpy:490
translate chinese day13_choice_776b40e2:

    # w "But you were going to."
    w "但你正打算说"

# game/script day13.rpy:492
translate chinese day13_choice_5ee6b57c:

    # w "I know that you somehow have gotten that stupid idea into your head, and now you seem to think that maybe—just maybe—if you try hard enough..."
    w "我知道你不知怎么产生了这种愚蠢的想法，现在你似乎还觉得，也许——只要你足够努力……"

# game/script day13.rpy:496
translate chinese day13_choice_72a552b9:

    # w "Spare the effort."
    w "省省力气吧"

# game/script day13.rpy:498
translate chinese day13_choice_7460ffff:

    # p "But maybe if-"
    p "但如果——"

# game/script day13.rpy:502
translate chinese day13_choice_25691c33:

    # "His claws snap through the air, silencing you before the thought leaves your lips."
    "他的爪子在空中猛地抓出一声脆响，在你的想法说出口之前就让你彻底安静下"

# game/script day13.rpy:504
translate chinese day13_choice_575f5452:

    # w "There is no maybe."
    w "没有如果"

# game/script day13.rpy:508
translate chinese day13_choice_4b0781ad:

    # w "I understand this is difficult for you. That the future is uncertain. That it frightens you."
    w "我明白这对你来说很难，未来充满未知，它让你害怕"

# game/script day13.rpy:510
translate chinese day13_choice_4cbcbd30:

    # w "Of course it does. It would anyone."
    w "当然会，任何人都会"

# game/script day13.rpy:512
translate chinese day13_choice_218e502d:

    # w "But I will not be leaving this ship."
    w "但我不会离开这艘船。"

# game/script day13.rpy:516
translate chinese day13_choice_5a508e88:

    # w "Not for you."
    w "不是因为你"

# game/script day13.rpy:518
translate chinese day13_choice_b752719f:

    # w "Not for anyone."
    w "不因为任何人"

# game/script day13.rpy:520
translate chinese day13_choice_bb15abea:

    # w "I signed on for this work, and I'll remain until they drag me off themselves."
    w "这份活我既然接了就会干到底，除非他们亲自来拖我走"

# game/script day13.rpy:527
translate chinese day13_choice_d8a18e4f:

    # "Julian shifts uneasily."
    "Julian不安地动了动"

# game/script day13.rpy:529
translate chinese day13_choice_f678c55b:

    # j "If you'd prefer, I can step away. Sounds like you two need to work through some-"
    j "如果你愿意的话，我可以走开，看起来你们两个需要解决一些——"

# game/script day13.rpy:533
translate chinese day13_choice_dc54f77c:

    # "Wolf cuts him off without even sparing him a glance."
    "Wolf打断了他，甚至没瞥他一眼"

# game/script day13.rpy:540
translate chinese day13_choice_c6801100:

    # w "There is nothing to {i}work through.{/i}"
    w "没有什么需要{i}解决的{/i}"

# game/script day13.rpy:542
translate chinese day13_choice_a26cc2bb:

    # w "I am just making it clear—without wanting to leave even the shadow of a doubt—that I will not be coming along."
    w "我只是想把话说清楚，不留下任何一丝疑虑——我不会一起去"

# game/script day13.rpy:544
translate chinese day13_choice_d7b1ac9a:

    # p "Wolf..."
    p "Wolf……"

# game/script day13.rpy:546
translate chinese day13_choice_f5905d6c:

    # w "It's not for myself, but for you."
    w "这不是为我自己，是为你好"

# game/script day13.rpy:548
translate chinese day13_choice_10d4e6d1:

    # w "So you can stop clinging to the illusion that I ever might."
    w "这样你就能别再抱着我可能会去的幻想了"

# game/script day13.rpy:550
translate chinese day13_choice_6330a08e:

    # "Your eyes are glued to him."
    "你的眼睛紧盯着他"

# game/script day13.rpy:552
translate chinese day13_choice_3e417f7f:

    # "You wait for him to relent."
    "你等着他心软"

# game/script day13.rpy:554
translate chinese day13_choice_6d4620e6:

    # "To take it back."
    "然后收回他的话"

# game/script day13.rpy:556
translate chinese day13_choice_2fc8cdac:

    # "But he doesn't."
    "但他没有"

# game/script day13.rpy:558
translate chinese day13_choice_d7a40912:

    # "Despite what little hope you may have had."
    "尽管你或许曾抱有那么一丝希望"

# game/script day13.rpy:560
translate chinese day13_choice_3b1dba09:

    # "And perhaps you were a fool to ever think otherwise. Thinking that he would ever consider coming along."
    "你之前会有别的想法，恐怕你还是太傻了，竟然以为他会考虑和你一起去"

# game/script day13.rpy:567
translate chinese day13_choice_2fdb29a4:

    # "What about Julian, then?"
    "那Julian呢？"

# game/script day13.rpy:572
translate chinese day13_choice_0eaac904:

    # "The steady drip, drip, drip of water interrupts your thoughts, as Julian hefts his bucket and stands up."
    "稳定滴落的水声打断了你的思绪，Julian提起桶站了起来"

# game/script day13.rpy:574
translate chinese day13_choice_276d6e89:

    # j "This water's filthy... I'll fetch another."
    j "这水脏了……我去换一桶"

# game/script day13.rpy:579
translate chinese day13_choice_52790352:

    # "He moves past the benches on the deck, the bucket dragging at his arm."
    "他从甲板上的长椅旁走过，手臂拖着水桶"

# game/script day13.rpy:581
translate chinese day13_choice_adf8c3c1:

    # "His tail sways with each step, nearly toppling a mug before he catches himself with a twitch of balance."
    "他的尾巴每走一步都在摆动，差点打翻一个杯子，他连忙一动保持平衡才稳住"

# game/script day13.rpy:590
translate chinese day13_choice_696dbdc1:

    # "You watch him vanish up the hatch—fighting the sway of the ship and leaving you with the silence of Wolf."
    "你看着他在船身的摇晃中爬上舱口消失，只留下你和Wolf陷入沉默"

# game/script day13.rpy:592
translate chinese day13_choice_d924be22:

    # "Your throat feels parched, and Julian's absence only sharpens the urgency of your situation."
    "你感到喉咙干涩，Julian的不在场只会让你当前处境的紧迫感变得更加强烈"

# game/script day13.rpy:594
translate chinese day13_choice_7d68b139:

    # "It really is now or never."
    "机不可失，时不再来"

# game/script day13.rpy:596
translate chinese day13_choice_dff17b54:

    # "You don't have time anymore."
    "你没有时间了"

# game/script day13.rpy:598
translate chinese day13_choice_c8e1e41f:

    # "After today, you'll be alone."
    "过了今天，你就孤身一人了"

# game/script day13.rpy:605
translate chinese day13_choice_8b6d5087:

    # p "Wolf?"
    p "Wolf？"

# game/script day13.rpy:609
translate chinese day13_choice_ad4993f3:

    # "He answers only with a long, heavy sigh."
    "他只用一声漫长而沉重的叹息作为回答"

# game/script day13.rpy:611
translate chinese day13_choice_65c6a59a:

    # p "I don't believe you when you say you want to stay here."
    p "你说你想留在这里，我不信"

# game/script day13.rpy:615
translate chinese day13_choice_58948578:

    # p "Getting yourself dirty with work like this."
    p "让自己被这种脏活弄脏"

# game/script day13.rpy:617
translate chinese day13_choice_3e215ed5:

    # p "Enduring Julian's constant nagging."
    p "忍受Julian没完没了的唠叨"

# game/script day13.rpy:619
translate chinese day13_choice_61b2e617:

    # p "No—I think, despite everything you claim, you {i}do{/i} want to leave."
    p "不——我认为，无论你声称什么，你{i}确实{/i}是想要离开的"

# game/script day13.rpy:622
translate chinese day13_choice_5e64191a:

    # p "{cps=5000}No—I think, despite everything you claim, you do want to leave.{/cps}" nointeract
    p "{cps=5000}不——我认为，无论你声称什么，你确实是想要离开的{/cps}" nointeract

# game/script day13.rpy:629
translate chinese day13_choice_50e1b1ad:

    # p "And I can't blame you. Truth be told, I'd be lying if I said I wouldn't look forward to some distance from Julian myself."
    p "我不怪你，说实话，我自己也想离Julian远点"

# game/script day13.rpy:631
translate chinese day13_choice_6f36a362:

    # p "The endless chatter... it feels like I haven't had a single quiet moment since he came aboard."
    p "那无休止的唠叨…… 自从他上船以来，我感觉自己连一刻安静的时间都没有"

# game/script day13.rpy:633
translate chinese day13_choice_dfe5d640:

    # p "I can put up with it for a while, but just like you, I need some silence now and then."
    p "我可以忍受一段时间，但和你一样，我偶尔也需要一些安静"

# game/script day13.rpy:635
translate chinese day13_choice_a1d03ccb:

    # p "A rare treasure on a ship and with him always at our heels."
    p "在船上，有他总跟在我们屁股后面，安静可是稀罕物"

# game/script day13.rpy:639
translate chinese day13_choice_966eaa52:

    # "You let out a weary sigh, perhaps just a touch exaggerated for effect."
    "你发出一声疲惫的叹息，或许为了效果夸张了那么一点点"

# game/script day13.rpy:643
translate chinese day13_choice_5a058a46:

    # "You let out a weary sigh."
    "你发出一声疲惫的叹息"

# game/script day13.rpy:647
translate chinese day13_choice_62e19213:

    # w "Sounds like fortune smiles on you, then."
    w "听起来幸运在向你招手了，那么"

# game/script day13.rpy:649
translate chinese day13_choice_1a5b5ede:

    # p "And it could smile on you as well."
    p "它也可以向你微笑"

# game/script day13.rpy:651
translate chinese day13_choice_f5ea674f:

    # p "No Julian. No work. Just..."
    p "没有Julian，没有工作，只有……"

# game/script day13.rpy:653
translate chinese day13_choice_b61fa240:

    # p "Freedom."
    p "自由"

# game/script day13.rpy:655
translate chinese day13_choice_073bb702:

    # "You lean in closer, lowering your voice to a hushed whisper."
    "你凑得更近，把声音压低成悄声耳语"

# game/script day13.rpy:659
translate chinese day13_choice_0fd8e231:

    # p "Don't tell him I said that, though. I think he still assumes I'm his friend."
    p "不过别告诉他我说了这些。我想他还以为我是他的朋友呢"

# game/script day13.rpy:663
translate chinese day13_choice_3d08616b:

    # w "Is this what you do with everyone you know?"
    w "这就是你对所有认识的人做的事吗？"

# game/script day13.rpy:665
translate chinese day13_choice_992bb2c6:

    # p "I'm sorry?"
    p "你说什么？"

# game/script day13.rpy:669
translate chinese day13_choice_fc95928e:

    # w "Use them the moment it's convenient?"
    w "一方便就利用他们？"

# game/script day13.rpy:673
translate chinese day13_choice_9727ff10:

    # p "Don't tell him I said that though."
    p "不过别告诉他我说了这些"

# game/script day13.rpy:677
translate chinese day13_choice_5413b157:

    # w "You really are desperate..."
    w "你可真是走投无路了……"

# game/script day13.rpy:679
translate chinese day13_choice_2d15012c:

    # w "Do you take me for an idiot?"
    w "你当我是白痴吗？"

# game/script day13.rpy:681
translate chinese day13_choice_98eac4d5:

    # w "Do you think I am blind to someone's attempts to manipulate me?"
    w "你以为我看不出有人试图操纵我吗？"

# game/script day13.rpy:683
translate chinese day13_choice_51704e8c:

    # w "Desperate men are dangerous. Rash, reckless, and they'll say anything if they think it'll save their pelt."
    w "走投无路"

# game/script day13.rpy:687
translate chinese day13_choice_8cc56cc4:

    # w "And you reek of it."
    w "而现在你身上就散发着这种味道"

# game/script day13.rpy:689
translate chinese day13_choice_cbaacb6c:

    # "At once, you become painfully aware of your own smell, even though he clearly didn't mean it literally."
    "你立刻痛苦地意识到自己身上的气味，尽管他显然不是字面上的意思"

# game/script day13.rpy:691
translate chinese day13_choice_2ebbeef9:

    # "Still, in the stifling air of the ship it's not a pleasant sensation."
    "不过在船上闷热的空气里，这感觉并不愉快"

# game/script day13.rpy:693
translate chinese day13_choice_5b2bbdd0:

    # p "That's a-..."
    p "所以——"

# game/script day13.rpy:695
translate chinese day13_choice_8cb6fae9:

    # "Who are you fooling? He's right."
    "你又在骗谁呢？他说得对"

# game/script day13.rpy:697
translate chinese day13_choice_fbc7d090:

    # "You feel dirty. More so than usual."
    "你觉得自己脏透了，比平时还要脏"

# game/script day13.rpy:701
translate chinese day13_choice_32534732:

    # w "I'm not in the business of humoring desperate men."
    w "我可没兴趣迎合走投无路的人"

# game/script day13.rpy:703
translate chinese day13_choice_746d36ab:

    # w "I thought I had made that clear."
    w "我以为已经说得很清楚了"

# game/script day13.rpy:707
translate chinese day13_choice_671a242b:

    # "You try to form a reply, but he cuts you off before a sound escapes."
    "你试图组织语言回应，但在你发出声音之前，他就打断了你"

# game/script day13.rpy:709
translate chinese day13_choice_5108c4cd:

    # "You feel your stomach lurch again."
    "你感到胃里又是一阵翻腾"

# game/script day13.rpy:711
translate chinese day13_choice_f8d43ec9:

    # w "I don't care."
    w "我不在乎"

# game/script day13.rpy:713
translate chinese day13_choice_0dab8d38:

    # w "Whatever you are going to say. I don't care."
    w "无论你打算说什么，我都不在乎"

# game/script day13.rpy:717
translate chinese day13_choice_dace1add:

    # w "And don't you dare try to rope in the lizard into your misery. He deserves better than you."
    w "别打Julian的主意，别把他扯进你的烂事里，他配得上比你好得多的"

# game/script day13.rpy:724
translate chinese day13_choice_38f0a883:

    # p "I tell you, there is an opportunity to do just that coming up."
    p "正好有个做成这事的机会"

# game/script day13.rpy:726
translate chinese day13_choice_d962d51f:

    # p "You just have to seize it."
    p "你只需要抓住它"

# game/script day13.rpy:728
translate chinese day13_choice_1004cf30:

    # p "Only those bold enough to take risks can ever claim the reward, Wolf."
    p "只有敢于冒险的人才能获得奖赏，Wolf"

# game/script day13.rpy:732
translate chinese day13_choice_1a1d583d:

    # "Wolf pinches the bridge of his snout in what almost looks like thoughtfulness."
    "Wolf用爪子捏了捏自己的鼻梁，那动作看起来近乎沉思"

# game/script day13.rpy:734
translate chinese day13_choice_267555ff:

    # "A rare expression for him."
    "这表情对他来说很罕见"

# game/script day13.rpy:736
translate chinese day13_choice_9a02d0d4:

    # "But the frown he hides behind his paw betrays that it is born from irritation rather than contemplation."
    "可他用爪子遮住的皱眉出卖了他，那不是在思考，是在不爽"

# game/script day13.rpy:738
translate chinese day13_choice_518fdfd7:

    # w "A risk is just that. A risk."
    w "风险就是风险，仅此而已"

# game/script day13.rpy:742
translate chinese day13_choice_c1fb2587:

    # w "Does your so-called philosophy of the bold say anything about the possible consequences?"
    w "你那套所谓的“勇者哲学”，提过半点后果吗？"

# game/script day13.rpy:744
translate chinese day13_choice_5aa19942:

    # p "Well-"
    p "这个——"

# game/script day13.rpy:748
translate chinese day13_choice_00d66352:

    # w "Don't bother. I know it doesn't."
    w "不必费心，我知道它没提"

# game/script day13.rpy:750
translate chinese day13_choice_fbc30179:

    # w "I didn't sign on to gamble my life, or to run off with the first fool who asks for the pleasure."
    w "我没有同意拿我的生命去冒险，也不会一有傻瓜邀请就逃走"

# game/script day13.rpy:752
translate chinese day13_choice_b7ed443a:

    # "You open your muzzle to argue further, but he cuts in before you can utter a word."
    "你张嘴正要争辩，还没出声就被他打断"

# game/script day13.rpy:756
translate chinese day13_choice_a358c731:

    # w "We're finished with this."
    w "到此为止吧"

# game/script day13.rpy:758
translate chinese day13_choice_6703b142:

    # "He points at the bucket sitting in front of you."
    "他指着你面前的水桶"

# game/script day13.rpy:760
translate chinese day13_choice_e972834c:

    # w "Eyes down. Scrub. Understood?"
    w "眼睛向下看，擦洗，明白了吗？"

# game/script day13.rpy:762
translate chinese day13_choice_8534ca42:

    # ". . ."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:764
translate chinese day13_choice_4bc1ad1e:

    # p "Yessir..."
    p "是，长官……"

# game/script day13.rpy:774
translate chinese day13_choice_83c069ec:

    # "You pause, rehearsing lines in your head, twisting and reshaping them again and again."
    "你停顿下来，在脑海中预演着话语，一遍又一遍地扭曲和重塑它们"

# game/script day13.rpy:776
translate chinese day13_choice_564f3dda:

    # "What could possibly convince someone like him?"
    "有什么能够说服像他这样的人？"

# game/script day13.rpy:778
translate chinese day13_choice_18444e9f:

    # "Nothing else you've tried has worked."
    "你试过的其他方法都没用"

# game/script day13.rpy:780
translate chinese day13_choice_6f5e5468:

    # "You need something different."
    "你需要点不一样的"

# game/script day13.rpy:782
translate chinese day13_choice_0d177cd2:

    # "Just what?..."
    "究竟是什么……"

# game/script day13.rpy:784
translate chinese day13_choice_442c27de:

    # "Something drastic."
    "一些极端的手段"

# game/script day13.rpy:786
translate chinese day13_choice_5699d86d:

    # p "Look, I know this might sound stupid."
    p "听着，我知道这听起来很傻"

# game/script day13.rpy:790
translate chinese day13_choice_42f2b802:

    # w "It already does."
    w "已经听起来很蠢了"

# game/script day13.rpy:792
translate chinese day13_choice_10ee81bd:

    # p "Maybe it is, maybe it isn't... but-"
    p "也许蠢，也许不蠢……但是——"

# game/script day13.rpy:794
translate chinese day13_choice_d69b895a:

    # p "I need you Wolf. More than anything. I want you to come with me."
    p "我需要你，Wolf，比任何东西都需要，我想要你跟我一起走"

# game/script day13.rpy:796
translate chinese day13_choice_13045bb0:

    # "He sighs at the apparent inescapable torture in cat shape he is bound to endure."
    "这猫形的折磨看来是躲不掉了"

# game/script day13.rpy:798
translate chinese day13_choice_a3c9f3a2:

    # p "I want us to face what's ahead. Together."
    p "我希望我们能一起面对前方的一切"

# game/script day13.rpy:800
translate chinese day13_choice_58829f73:

    # p "And I would do {i}anything{/i} to make you see just how much this opportunity could mean for you, too."
    p "为了让你看清这个机会对你有多重要，我{i}什么都愿意做{/i}"

# game/script day13.rpy:802
translate chinese day13_choice_392aefaa:

    # p "To leave all of this behind. {w}Even if only temporarily.{w} Until we're back home."
    p "离开这一切，{w}即便只是暂时，{w}直到我们回到家乡"

# game/script day13.rpy:804
translate chinese day13_choice_dc6c9ca0:

    # p "Think of it as just another job. Maybe I can't pay you in coin, but there are other ways I could... compensate you."
    p "就当是出趟任务，钱我给不了，但我可以用别的方式……补偿你"

# game/script day13.rpy:811
translate chinese day13_choice_8e593cd6:

    # "You lean toward him, trying to balance suggestion with restraint, to look inviting without appearing desperate."
    "你向他靠近，试图在暗示与克制之间找到平衡，看起来诱人却又不显得绝望"

# game/script day13.rpy:813
translate chinese day13_choice_eef8e2f1:

    # w "You're a farmer's boy turned sailor.{w} What in the world could you possibly offer?"
    w "田舍郎出身的水手"

# game/script day13.rpy:817
translate chinese day13_choice_088d816a:

    # "You smirk faintly, lowering your voice to a near-whisper."
    "你淡淡地冷笑一声，将声音压低到近乎耳语"

# game/script day13.rpy:819
translate chinese day13_choice_63733c91:

    # p "You really can't imagine {i}anything{/i}?"
    p "你真的想不出{i}任何东西{/i}吗？"

# game/script day13.rpy:821
translate chinese day13_choice_9ed98f7e:

    # "A quick glance around confirms no one is listening. You lower your voice even more."
    "在快速扫视一圈后，确认没人在听，你把声音压得更低"

# game/script day13.rpy:823
translate chinese day13_choice_21613d72:

    # p "I'm talking about the kind of entertainment between two people far from home."
    p "我说的是两个离家在外的人之间那种……娱乐"

# game/script day13.rpy:827
translate chinese day13_choice_44ae5899:

    # w "I don't care for opera."
    w "我对歌剧没兴趣"

# game/script day13.rpy:829
translate chinese day13_choice_8e75dc02:

    # p "Not-...{w} Not Opera."
    p "不……{w}不是歌剧"

# game/script day13.rpy:831
translate chinese day13_choice_16555771:

    # p "Other {i}merriments{/i}."
    p "其他{i}乐子{/i}"

# game/script day13.rpy:833
translate chinese day13_choice_3f314f42:

    # w "Opera, theater, circus it—makes no difference."
    w "歌剧，戏剧，马戏——这些都没区别"

# game/script day13.rpy:835
translate chinese day13_choice_a1f6e8fc:

    # "Surely he can't be this dense..."
    "他总不至于这么迟钝吧……"

# game/script day13.rpy:839
translate chinese day13_choice_bc2e5ba9:

    # p "My goodness Wolf! I'm talking about-"
    p "我的老天爷，Wolf！我说的是——"

# game/script day13.rpy:846
translate chinese day13_choice_1c68a1e8:

    # "You catch yourself just in time as your raised voice draws a few curious looks."
    "你提高的嗓音引来了几道好奇的目光，你及时控制住了自己"

# game/script day13.rpy:848
translate chinese day13_choice_6f73458c:

    # "Some linger on you for a moment before turning away. You quickly drop your voice again."
    "有人多看了你一眼才转开，你立刻放低声音"

# game/script day13.rpy:855
translate chinese day13_choice_a4ab4481:

    # p "I am talking about bodily pleasures. As often as you want. Whenever you want."
    p "我说的是身体上的愉悦，随时想要就有，想什么时候就什么时候"

# game/script day13.rpy:859
translate chinese day13_choice_26afb310:

    # p "You've already seen what I have to offer with a raised tail. We could take it further, you know."
    p "你已经看到我把尾巴翘起来时能提供的东西了，你知道的，我们可以更进一步"

# game/script day13.rpy:861
translate chinese day13_choice_590e5ee9:

    # p "I'll wake you with my muzzle under the sheets every morning, if that's what you want."
    p "如果你想要，我每天早上都可以在被单下用嘴把你叫醒"

# game/script day13.rpy:863
translate chinese day13_choice_9c4de46e:

    # p "Just, please..."
    p "就……求你了……"

# game/script day13.rpy:865
translate chinese day13_choice_d7b1ac9a_1:

    # p "Wolf..."
    p ""

# game/script day13.rpy:869
translate chinese day13_choice_dfe9fe00:

    # "Wolf takes what may be the longest breath in history."
    "Wolf吸了一口气，那可能是史上最长的一口气"

# game/script day13.rpy:871
translate chinese day13_choice_5f9270a6:

    # "His nose twitches faintly."
    "他的鼻子微微抽动了一下"

# game/script day13.rpy:873
translate chinese day13_choice_27fea492:

    # "He opens his eyes."
    "他睁开了眼睛"

# game/script day13.rpy:877
translate chinese day13_choice_13d6c76d:

    # "He didn't threaten to kill you yet. Maybe...?"
    "他还没说要杀你，也许……？"

# game/script day13.rpy:879
translate chinese day13_choice_d34bee83:

    # "He's considering it?"
    "他已经在考虑了？"

# game/script day13.rpy:886
translate chinese day13_choice_197fe030:

    # "Then, he rises to his paws and walks away."
    "然后，他站起身，走开了"

# game/script day13.rpy:888
translate chinese day13_choice_70213754:

    # "On his way out, he brushes past Julian, who waits until Wolf clears the narrow walkway."
    "他出去时，擦过Julian身边，他等着，直到Wolf走出窄廊"

# game/script day13.rpy:890
translate chinese day13_choice_e3de106b:

    # j "{alpha=0.5}Where are you going? Are we done already?{/alpha}"
    j "{alpha=0.5}你去哪儿？这就完了？{/alpha}"

# game/script day13.rpy:892
translate chinese day13_choice_3c241853:

    # w "{alpha=0.5}I decided I'd rather be yelled at by Mr. Hudson than spend another moment with him.{/alpha}"
    w "{alpha=0.5}我想好了，宁愿被Hudson先生骂，也不想再跟他多待一刻{/alpha}"

# game/script day13.rpy:897
translate chinese day13_choice_4365a800:

    # "Julian looks baffled, glancing after Wolf several times as he steps closer."
    "Julian愣住了，望着Wolf的背影看了好几眼，才慢慢走过来"

# game/script day13.rpy:899
translate chinese day13_choice_ceb2d6d1:

    # "He points a thumb over his shoulder."
    "他用拇指朝肩后指了指"

# game/script day13.rpy:901
translate chinese day13_choice_4b0d5eb9:

    # j "What on earth is wrong with him?"
    j "他到底怎么了？"

# game/script day13.rpy:903
translate chinese day13_choice_4d9bdef6:

    # j "What did you say?"
    j "你说了什么？"

# game/script day13.rpy:905
translate chinese day13_choice_31285a54:

    # "You shrug your shoulders."
    "你耸了耸肩"

# game/script day13.rpy:907
translate chinese day13_choice_e8763d15:

    # p "Nothing."
    p "没什么"

# game/script day13.rpy:909
translate chinese day13_choice_a64fe071:

    # j "Nothing?"
    j "没什么？"

# game/script day13.rpy:911
translate chinese day13_choice_a43a9db6:

    # j "YOU MADE HIM WALK OFF!"
    j "你把他气走了！"

# game/script day13.rpy:913
translate chinese day13_choice_e88b07b9:

    # j "Did you propose to marry him?!"
    j "你难道向他求婚了？！"

# game/script day13.rpy:915
translate chinese day13_choice_7718e721:

    # "He sets the heavy bucket down with a heavy thump that rattles the planks beneath."
    "他放下沉重的桶，发出一声沉闷的撞击声，震动了下方的木板"

# game/script day13.rpy:917
translate chinese day13_choice_d85a0714:

    # p "Don't be ridiculous. I didn't."
    p "别胡扯，我没有"

# game/script day13.rpy:921
translate chinese day13_choice_6de19792:

    # j "Now we've got even more work to do without him!"
    j "现在他不在了，我们活儿更多了！"

# game/script day13.rpy:923
translate chinese day13_choice_908d5364:

    # p "We just talked."
    p "我们只是聊了聊"

# game/script day13.rpy:925
translate chinese day13_choice_a7ab267f:

    # p "And he up and left."
    p "然后他就起身走了"

# game/script day13.rpy:927
translate chinese day13_choice_e232eb5a:

    # j "You're the worst liar, you know that?"
    j "你知道你最不会撒谎了吗？"

# game/script day13.rpy:937
translate chinese day13_choice_6911e79a:

    # "You pause, searching for what you might say."
    "你停顿下来，搜寻着可能说的话"

# game/script day13.rpy:939
translate chinese day13_choice_6566f868:

    # "But in that silence, the truth settles over you that there might not be anything left to say."
    "但在那片沉默中，你认清了一个事实，也许已经没有什么话值得再说"

# game/script day13.rpy:941
translate chinese day13_choice_613dc0d4:

    # "Wolf is right not to follow you off this ship."
    "Wolf他不跟你下船是对的"

# game/script day13.rpy:943
translate chinese day13_choice_fb47aae7:

    # "You know how reckless it would be... so why do you expect him to help shoulder your fate?"
    "你知道这有多荒唐……那你凭什么指望他，替你扛这份命？"

# game/script day13.rpy:945
translate chinese day13_choice_e232168a:

    # "You shouldn't want him to make that mistake only because you're afraid of what's to come."
    "你不能因为害怕接下来的事就拉着他一起犯错"

# game/script day13.rpy:947
translate chinese day13_choice_7a91e544:

    # p "I'm sorry.{w}You're right. It's your decision to make, not mine."
    p "对不起，你说得对，是该你做决定，不是我"

# game/script day13.rpy:949
translate chinese day13_choice_d4b321ae:

    # p "Just know... I would have liked for you to come."
    p "只是要知道……我本来希望你能来的"

# game/script day13.rpy:951
translate chinese day13_choice_b48aa2d3:

    # p "That's all."
    p "就这样"

# game/script day13.rpy:953
translate chinese day13_choice_14a396e7:

    # "He holds your gaze as if waiting for more—then drops his eyes."
    "他注视着你的目光，仿佛在等待更多话语，然后垂下了眼眸"

# game/script day13.rpy:955
translate chinese day13_choice_0c221670:

    # "He picks up another bowl and runs his thumb firmly along its rim, scraping away the hardened flake of yesterday's dinner."
    "他拿起另一只碗，拇指狠狠蹭着碗边，刮掉干硬的饭垢"

# game/script day13.rpy:957
translate chinese day13_choice_78a51376:

    # w "I wish you good luck, [name]."
    w "祝你好运，[name]"

# game/script day13.rpy:965
translate chinese day13_choice_82bc87da:

    # j "What to do?... What to do?..."
    j "该怎么办？……该怎么办？……"

# game/script day13.rpy:969
translate chinese day13_choice_3678d061:

    # w "Just pick something..."
    w "随便选一个吧……"

# game/script day13.rpy:973
translate chinese day13_choice_fe7d8680:

    # j "But what if it doesn't like me, Wolf?"
    j "可它要是不喜欢我怎么办，Wolf？"

# game/script day13.rpy:977
translate chinese day13_choice_0c731ef2:

    # j "No, no, no... It has to be a good fit, or else I'll have no joy cleaning it, and it won't enjoy having my grubby mitts all over it."
    j "不行，不行，不行……一定要合得来才行，不然我擦着没兴致，它被我这脏手摸来摸去，也不会舒服"

# game/script day13.rpy:979
translate chinese day13_choice_fda0cf84:

    # p "Speaking of what to do, Jules..."
    p "说到该做些什么，Jules……"

# game/script day13.rpy:986
translate chinese day13_choice_ba57c85c:

    # "He pauses, waiting for you to go on, then finally picks up a tool encrusted with dried tar."
    "他停顿下来，等待你继续说下去，最后拿起了一件覆着干油渍的工具"

# game/script day13.rpy:988
translate chinese day13_choice_e4eff344:

    # j "Hm...?"
    j "嗯……？"

# game/script day13.rpy:990
translate chinese day13_choice_4ea40174:

    # p "Do you know what you want to do?"
    p "你想好要做什么了吗？"

# game/script day13.rpy:992
translate chinese day13_choice_afe53122:

    # p "In Morocco, I mean."
    p "我指在摩洛哥的时候"

# game/script day13.rpy:994
translate chinese day13_choice_bb21cc51:

    # j "I told you I'm just not sure yet."
    j "我说过，我只是还不确定而已"

# game/script day13.rpy:997
translate chinese day13_choice_8c2262bc:

    # j "I told you I'm just not sure yet." nointeract
    j "" nointeract

# game/script day13.rpy:1005
translate chinese day13_choice_8c742a8f:

    # p "You're not at all interested in roaming around together?"
    p "你一点跟我一起逛逛的兴趣都没有吗？"

# game/script day13.rpy:1007
translate chinese day13_choice_45f99c8f:

    # j "I am..."
    j "我还是有点兴趣的……"

# game/script day13.rpy:1009
translate chinese day13_choice_07c6d6ff:

    # j "Of course I am, but what you're asking for is a lot, [name]."
    j "我当然愿意，只是你的要求实在是强人所难了，[name]"

# game/script day13.rpy:1011
translate chinese day13_choice_60c01519:

    # j "No doubt you are aware of that as well."
    j "毫无疑问你对此也同样清楚"

# game/script day13.rpy:1013
translate chinese day13_choice_555eb704:

    # "You are."
    "你确实明白"

# game/script day13.rpy:1015
translate chinese day13_choice_2f4a0f54:

    # "That's the very reason why you don't want to go it alone."
    "这正是你不想独自前往的原因"

# game/script day13.rpy:1017
translate chinese day13_choice_8d4a9c54:

    # p "I know... but, together?"
    p "我知道……但是，如果我们一起呢？"

# game/script day13.rpy:1019
translate chinese day13_choice_ab5afb97:

    # p "What could stop us?"
    p "还有什么能阻止我们？"

# game/script day13.rpy:1023
translate chinese day13_choice_d6e39538:

    # j "You ever ran away and tried to start a new life before, [name]? 'Cause I doubt it's like strolling through town square with a coin in your pocket."
    j "你以前有没有逃离过往，想尝试开始新的生活吗，[name]？这与你口袋里有硬币却仍旧在城镇广场散步完全不同"

# game/script day13.rpy:1025
translate chinese day13_choice_c19da306:

    # p "And that's why it's all the more reason to do it together."
    p "所以这更能说明我们应该一起行动"

# game/script day13.rpy:1029
translate chinese day13_choice_ef23de7c:

    # p "A whole new country at our fingertips.{w} Just you and me."
    p "一整个全新的国度近在咫尺，{w}只有你和我"

# game/script day13.rpy:1031
translate chinese day13_choice_7693ee8a:

    # p "I heard they have deserts there, sand as far as the eye can see. And now imagine us two right in it. Watching the sunset."
    p "我听说那里有一望无际的沙漠，现在且想象一下我们两个就在沙漠里，一同看着日落"

# game/script day13.rpy:1033
translate chinese day13_choice_e56f7fa1:

    # p "We'd go where no one knows our names."
    p "我们会去一个没人知道我们名字的地方"

# game/script day13.rpy:1035
translate chinese day13_choice_9387720b:

    # p "No hierarchy. No chores. Just two guys seeing what's out there."
    p "没有尊卑高下，没有琐碎杂活，就我们两个，去外面闯荡看看世界"

# game/script day13.rpy:1039
translate chinese day13_choice_da93abeb:

    # j "Sounds like a fool's paradise."
    j "听着就像痴人说梦一样不切实际"

# game/script day13.rpy:1041
translate chinese day13_choice_3c4cbba1:

    # p "Better that than a floating cell."
    p "总比这漂浮的牢笼强"

# game/script day13.rpy:1043
translate chinese day13_choice_3b654b29:

    # p "We'd share stories."
    p "我们会分享故事"

# game/script day13.rpy:1045
translate chinese day13_choice_bc23684e:

    # p "See what places we can discover."
    p "看看能发现哪些地方"

# game/script day13.rpy:1049
translate chinese day13_choice_3c64f51e:

    # p "Play music."
    p "演奏音乐"

# game/script day13.rpy:1053
translate chinese day13_choice_9b4b4d14:

    # p "With that much time on our hands I'm sure I'll even learn it myself."
    p "有这么多空闲时间，我肯定自己也能学着上手"

# game/script day13.rpy:1055
translate chinese day13_choice_6b304fb5:

    # p "Provided that you would have me as a student."
    p "如果你愿意收我为学生的话"

# game/script day13.rpy:1057
translate chinese day13_choice_d5149364:

    # p "Just taking it one day at a time."
    p "就这样一天天过下去"

# game/script day13.rpy:1059
translate chinese day13_choice_0f19061a:

    # "You lower your voice to an almost conspiratorial hush."
    "你压低了嗓音，近乎密谋般低声耳语"

# game/script day13.rpy:1061
translate chinese day13_choice_3a40e9a2:

    # p "Of course, all of that only after we've stolen a couple of fruits to accompany the sunset with."
    p "那是自然，不过得先偷摘几个果子，就且伴着落日一起品尝"

# game/script day13.rpy:1063
translate chinese day13_choice_65ea8529:

    # p "Plums or apples? What should we get?"
    p "我们该拿什么，李子？苹果？"

# game/script day13.rpy:1065
translate chinese day13_choice_ddff133e:

    # p "Grapes perhaps?"
    p "或许葡萄？"

# game/script day13.rpy:1069
translate chinese day13_choice_15a61558:

    # j "Plums."
    j "李子"

# game/script day13.rpy:1071
translate chinese day13_choice_e0f38f31:

    # p "And plums we'll have."
    p "那就拿李子"

# game/script day13.rpy:1073
translate chinese day13_choice_ff6f83b3:

    # p "You draw their attention while I grab a handful. They'll be none the wiser."
    p "你负责吸引他们注意，我顺手抓一把，神不知鬼不觉，没人发现"

# game/script day13.rpy:1075
translate chinese day13_choice_5ac1e2be:

    # "It may just be a fantasy, but for a second, you imagine his shoulder brushing yours in the orange light of the setting sun."
    "这也许只是一种幻想，但有那么一瞬间，你想象着，在橘色的落日余晖中，他的肩膀擦过你的肩膀"

# game/script day13.rpy:1079
translate chinese day13_choice_6ca2b262:

    # j "It's really bringing out your rogue-ish side, isn't it?"
    j "这下真的把你狡黠的一面显露出来了？"

# game/script day13.rpy:1083
translate chinese day13_choice_806651e6:

    # "After all the new faces you've seen, Julian's the one that stuck out to you."
    "你一路见惯了各色面孔，偏偏Julian最与众不同，牢牢印在你心上"

# game/script day13.rpy:1085
translate chinese day13_choice_86ec25f4:

    # "You were never quite the rogue type, but Julian's starting to rub off on you."
    "你向来都不是狡黠不羁的性子，现在倒渐渐被Julian给带偏了"

# game/script day13.rpy:1087
translate chinese day13_choice_0c6c7845:

    # "And you wouldn't mind being his partner in crime."
    "而且你不介意当他的犯罪同伙"

# game/script day13.rpy:1091
translate chinese day13_choice_8e85789f:

    # "You nod as your lips pull into a subtle grin."
    "你点了点头，嘴角勾起一抹含蓄的浅笑"

# game/script day13.rpy:1093
translate chinese day13_choice_27fe89e7:

    # p "Might be you that's the bad influence."
    p "搞不好你才是那个带坏别人的"

# game/script day13.rpy:1095
translate chinese day13_choice_5fb0eb2a:

    # p "Eventually we'll return back home."
    p "最终我们会归乡"

# game/script day13.rpy:1097
translate chinese day13_choice_76c8379d:

    # p "If we feel like it."
    p "如果我们想的话"

# game/script day13.rpy:1099
translate chinese day13_choice_9f3f3ecd:

    # p "Who knows? Perhaps we truly are fools, and what would be better for them than a fool's paradise?"
    p "世事浮沉，或许我们真的就是痴人，对其他人而言，没有什么比痴人幻想中的乐土更好的了"

# game/script day13.rpy:1106
translate chinese day13_choice_b8a3ae61:

    # w "Planning a mutiny?"
    w "策划哗变？"

# game/script day13.rpy:1110
translate chinese day13_choice_f9a1e0db:

    # "Wolf doesn't even look up from his work for the question."
    "Wolf忙于手头的工作，听到问题甚至没有抬起头来"

# game/script day13.rpy:1112
translate chinese day13_choice_c7115f3b:

    # p "Just discussing our plans for Morocco."
    p "只是在讨论我们去摩洛哥的计划"

# game/script day13.rpy:1114
translate chinese day13_choice_39ad7d8e:

    # p "You plan to join?"
    p "你也打算加入？"

# game/script day13.rpy:1116
translate chinese day13_choice_c4d669d1:

    # p "We'll get plums for three."
    p "我们会拿三人份的李子"

# game/script day13.rpy:1120
translate chinese day13_choice_833ad023:

    # w "I don't..."
    w "我不……"

# game/script day13.rpy:1122
translate chinese day13_choice_7a957f57:

    # w "You know that you should be careful around who you discuss your plans to leave."
    w "你心里应该有数，离开的计划千万别随便跟外人说起"

# game/script day13.rpy:1125
translate chinese day13_choice_2445db0f:

    # w "You really are just looking for trouble... Starting fights, now this."
    w "你可真是没事找事……动不动就自由搏击，现在又来这一出"

# game/script day13.rpy:1127
translate chinese day13_choice_dbe913f9:

    # w "Might not be a navy ship, but I doubt the upper class around here enjoys you going around trying to convince their crew to leave."
    w "尽管这还算不上是海军舰船，但我怀疑船上的长官们可绝不会喜欢你到处策反他们手下的船员出走"

# game/script day13.rpy:1129
translate chinese day13_choice_75c540f5:

    # p "Perhaps."
    p "或许吧"

# game/script day13.rpy:1131
translate chinese day13_choice_ea671615:

    # p "But you're not someone who I would consider the type of person to get us into trouble."
    p "我从来都不觉得你是会给我们惹麻烦的人"

# game/script day13.rpy:1139
translate chinese day13_choice_5b8d3fdc:

    # j "{i}Us{/i}?"
    j "{i}我们{/i}？"

# game/script day13.rpy:1143
translate chinese day13_choice_153315a2:

    # j "You."
    j "你"

# game/script day13.rpy:1145
translate chinese day13_choice_9b391f30:

    # j "Any trouble—should it arrive—is yours, my friend."
    j "任何麻烦——如果你惹出来了的话——都得算在你头上了，朋友"

# game/script day13.rpy:1147
translate chinese day13_choice_6a8c6263:

    # p "There won't be any."
    p "不会有麻烦的"

# game/script day13.rpy:1151
translate chinese day13_choice_a7c77766:

    # w "I won't, you're right."
    w "你说得对，我不会乱来的"

# game/script day13.rpy:1153
translate chinese day13_choice_4a0c1463:

    # w "What you do is none of my business."
    w "你做什么不关我的事"

# game/script day13.rpy:1155
translate chinese day13_choice_7f7bea16:

    # w "It was just a..."
    w "只是……"

# game/script day13.rpy:1159
translate chinese day13_choice_f29dfcbe:

    # "Wolf opens his muzzle to continue, then shakes off whatever thought it was."
    "Wolf张开嘴巴准备继续说下去，随后又抛开了脑中的思绪"

# game/script day13.rpy:1162
translate chinese day13_choice_91b422ab:

    # "Instead, he gets up to fetch more water."
    "他索性起身，去再打些水来"

# game/script day13.rpy:1164
translate chinese day13_choice_c1c98dfa:

    # w "Never mind."
    w "算了"

# game/script day13.rpy:1170
translate chinese day13_choice_7701734a:

    # "You watch him until he disappears up the stairs."
    "你看着他，直到他消失在楼梯上"

# game/script day13.rpy:1175
translate chinese day13_choice_3a4bdaf9:

    # j "The desert, huh?"
    j "沙漠，哈？"

# game/script day13.rpy:1177
translate chinese day13_choice_ea40343c:

    # "You go for another bowl to clean."
    "你又拿了一个碗来清洗"

# game/script day13.rpy:1181
translate chinese day13_choice_9fc7c570:

    # "Julian's leg begins to bounce like he can't sit still."
    "Julian的腿好似坐不住般开始抖动"

# game/script day13.rpy:1183
translate chinese day13_choice_c66bec85:

    # p "That's what I heard, at least."
    p "至少我听说是这样"

# game/script day13.rpy:1185
translate chinese day13_choice_e3132a09:

    # j "Sand as far as the eye can see? Must be a strange place."
    j "一望无际的沙漠？那一定是个奇怪的地方"

# game/script day13.rpy:1187
translate chinese day13_choice_c6dc560f:

    # p "Isn't it?"
    p "不是吗？"

# game/script day13.rpy:1189
translate chinese day13_choice_0de2e683:

    # p "Hard to imagine after more than a week of nothing but the sea."
    p "在整整一周多只能看见大海之后，实在难以想象"

# game/script day13.rpy:1193
translate chinese day13_choice_c66bec85_1:

    # p "That's what I heard, at least."
    p ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1195
translate chinese day13_choice_08a3a951:

    # j "The choice between being surrounded by water or sand..."
    j "是选择被水包围还是被沙包围……"

# game/script day13.rpy:1202
translate chinese day13_choice_6e03b01b:

    # "You understand his hesitation."
    "你理解他的犹豫"

# game/script day13.rpy:1204
translate chinese day13_choice_a1f009f4:

    # "How you'd like him to come along."
    "你是如此地希望他能一起来"

# game/script day13.rpy:1206
translate chinese day13_choice_34c91557:

    # "Your lives—shared so briefly."
    "你们的生命——就这般短暂地交汇"

# game/script day13.rpy:1208
translate chinese day13_choice_dce0db48:

    # "Perhaps that's all a ship like the {i}Conway{/i} is."
    "或许{i}康威号{/i}说到底也不过如此"

# game/script day13.rpy:1210
translate chinese day13_choice_cc8f86c0:

    # "A place of transitions."
    "一个过渡的地方"

# game/script day13.rpy:1212
translate chinese day13_choice_0653e54a:

    # "Nothing to call a home."
    "称不上是家，只不过是一个过渡的地方"

# game/script day13.rpy:1214
translate chinese day13_choice_7ce94cdb:

    # "Just coming."
    "只是到来"

# game/script day13.rpy:1216
translate chinese day13_choice_013a924e:

    # "And going."
    "而后离去"

# game/script day13.rpy:1218
translate chinese day13_choice_47b0c23e:

    # "Same as those working on it."
    "船上工作的人也不过如此"

# game/script day13.rpy:1220
translate chinese day13_choice_49fe160e:

    # "With your time on this transition so agonizingly cut short."
    "只是你在康威号上的时间被痛苦地缩短"

# game/script day13.rpy:1222
translate chinese day13_choice_bf0874e3:

    # "But..."
    "但是……"

# game/script day13.rpy:1224
translate chinese day13_choice_88d1de77:

    # "If it has to end, you want it to end with Julian."
    "如果一切终将结束，你希望是能和Julian一起画上句号"

# game/script day13.rpy:1226
translate chinese day13_choice_6c9c4e85:

    # "If you only knew how to get him to come..."
    "要是你知道怎么让他跟你走就好了……"

# game/script day13.rpy:1233
translate chinese day13_choice_e456706c:

    # p "You have to risk something occasionally."
    p "人偶尔总得冒一次险"

# game/script day13.rpy:1237
translate chinese day13_choice_30ca7b7d:

    # p "And ask yourself what you {i}really{/i} want, and whether it's worth taking the risk."
    p "扪心自问，你{i}真正{/i}想要的是什么，这份冒险到底值不值得"

# game/script day13.rpy:1239
translate chinese day13_choice_b5f38e3b:

    # p "Or else you'll just get stuck and be at the whims of other people."
    p "不然只会困在原地，一辈子都只能任由别人摆布"

# game/script day13.rpy:1241
translate chinese day13_choice_ad5179a6:

    # j "Right."
    j ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1243
translate chinese day13_choice_0d46c1d3:

    # "He sounds annoyed."
    "他的声音听起来有些恼火"

# game/script day13.rpy:1245
translate chinese day13_choice_18ccc506:

    # "You wish he weren't."
    "你希望他没有"

# game/script day13.rpy:1249
translate chinese day13_choice_d7486882:

    # "He submerges the tool in the water and begins to scrub it clean."
    "他把工具浸入水中开始擦洗"

# game/script day13.rpy:1251
translate chinese day13_choice_58330f6b:

    # "Small black dots of tar begin to swirl in the water."
    "细小的黑色油点开始在水中打旋"

# game/script day13.rpy:1253
translate chinese day13_choice_85f23662:

    # j "I know."
    j "我知道"

# game/script day13.rpy:1257
translate chinese day13_choice_1f3a1d5d:

    # j "I just..."
    j "我只是……"

# game/script day13.rpy:1259
translate chinese day13_choice_31ace2c7:

    # j "I want to pick my moments."
    j "我想自己选合适的时机"

# game/script day13.rpy:1261
translate chinese day13_choice_3e68fed3:

    # p "There is one coming up."
    p "很快就会有了"

# game/script day13.rpy:1265
translate chinese day13_choice_3afe7d01:

    # j "I know my way around that kind of risk."
    j "我很清楚该如何应对这类风险"

# game/script day13.rpy:1267
translate chinese day13_choice_8356ef4c:

    # j "Perhaps it's the one thing I do know."
    j "或许这是我唯一能确定的事"

# game/script day13.rpy:1269
translate chinese day13_choice_3b910b93:

    # j "Pa's been in the military since before I was born, and all I remember is being taught things like that."
    j "在我出生前父亲就已入伍，打我有记忆起，学的就一直是这些规矩道理"

# game/script day13.rpy:1271
translate chinese day13_choice_dda244b1:

    # j "How to handle risks, opportunities and lead at sea..."
    j "懂得如何在海上应对风险，把握机会，也知晓怎样带队掌舵……"

# game/script day13.rpy:1278
translate chinese day13_choice_1a369610:

    # w "You two planning a mutiny?"
    w "你们两个在策划哗变？"

# game/script day13.rpy:1282
translate chinese day13_choice_b5fa748e:

    # "Wolf doesn't even look up from his work."
    "Wolf甚至都没从工作中抬头"

# game/script day13.rpy:1284
translate chinese day13_choice_cde92cc7:

    # p "No."
    p "没有"

# game/script day13.rpy:1286
translate chinese day13_choice_47df3200:

    # p "Discussing our plans for Morocco."
    p "只是在讨论我们去摩洛哥的计划"

# game/script day13.rpy:1288
translate chinese day13_choice_fd197c83:

    # w "You know that you should be careful around who you discuss plans to leave."
    w "你心里应该有数，离开的计划千万别随便跟外人说起"

# game/script day13.rpy:1290
translate chinese day13_choice_65a9a9d9:

    # w "They won't allow that."
    w "他们不会允许的"

# game/script day13.rpy:1292
translate chinese day13_choice_dbe913f9_1:

    # w "Might not be a navy ship, but I doubt the upper class around here enjoys you going around trying to convince their crew to leave."
    w ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1294
translate chinese day13_choice_e5b5a3a2:

    # "You shrug him off."
    "你对他耸耸肩"

# game/script day13.rpy:1296
translate chinese day13_choice_70e3f740:

    # j "You don't have to tell me."
    j "这不用你提醒我"

# game/script day13.rpy:1298
translate chinese day13_choice_75c540f5_1:

    # p "Perhaps."
    p ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1300
translate chinese day13_choice_713ca6c4:

    # p "But you're not the type of person to go running to Mr. Hudson, Wolf."
    p "Wolf看起来也并不是会跑去向Hudson先生告密的那种人"

# game/script day13.rpy:1304
translate chinese day13_choice_599917bd:

    # "He closes his eyes."
    "他闭上眼睛"

# game/script day13.rpy:1306
translate chinese day13_choice_4b89e391:

    # w "You would be correct."
    w "你说得对"

# game/script day13.rpy:1308
translate chinese day13_choice_4a0c1463_1:

    # w "What you do is none of my business."
    w ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1310
translate chinese day13_choice_7f7bea16_1:

    # w "It was just a..."
    w ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1314
translate chinese day13_choice_f29dfcbe_1:

    # "Wolf opens his muzzle to continue, then shakes off whatever thought it was."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1317
translate chinese day13_choice_91b422ab_1:

    # "Instead, he gets up to fetch more water."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1319
translate chinese day13_choice_c1c98dfa_1:

    # w "Never mind."
    w ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1325
translate chinese day13_choice_7701734a_1:

    # "You watch him until he disappears up the stairs."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1330
translate chinese day13_choice_8d12b606:

    # "Julian's hands don't stop working, but the rhythm slows."
    "朱利安手里依旧忙着不停，只是节奏慢了下来"

# game/script day13.rpy:1332
translate chinese day13_choice_353b6559:

    # "For a moment, you think he might say something."
    "有那么一瞬间你以为他会说些什么"

# game/script day13.rpy:1334
translate chinese day13_choice_07d97394:

    # "But instead, he sniffs, scratches the side of his nose, and leaves a small mark of tar."
    "但他只是抽了抽鼻子，挠了挠鼻翼，蹭出了一小块油印子"

# game/script day13.rpy:1338
translate chinese day13_choice_4ab3e9f3:

    # j "You're not wrong."
    j "你说得没错"

# game/script day13.rpy:1340
translate chinese day13_choice_96ba4a45:

    # j "About getting stuck."
    j "关于漂浮着的牢笼这件事"

# game/script day13.rpy:1342
translate chinese day13_choice_eeec667b:

    # j "But some unfortunately have to play the hand they were dealt."
    j "可有些人命不由己，只能被迫接受命运的安排，没得选择"

# game/script day13.rpy:1346
translate chinese day13_choice_5ae0cf99:

    # j "And I don't know if I can give up so easily."
    j "可我做不到就这么轻易放弃"

# game/script day13.rpy:1348
translate chinese day13_choice_eebef51e:

    # j "With my father counting on me."
    j "毕竟我父亲还指望着我"

# game/script day13.rpy:1350
translate chinese day13_choice_6a8a8e18:

    # p "Julian..."
    p "Julian……"

# game/script day13.rpy:1352
translate chinese day13_choice_7395d5ac:

    # p "He doesn't hav-"
    p "他没有——"

# game/script day13.rpy:1356
translate chinese day13_choice_2e4d15a3:

    # "He cuts you off."
    "他打断了你"

# game/script day13.rpy:1358
translate chinese day13_choice_4bf6e591:

    # j "It's still my family, [name]."
    j "那仍然是我的家人，[family_name]"

# game/script day13.rpy:1360
translate chinese day13_choice_c443cab0:

    # "For a few moments neither of you break the lingering silence."
    "一时间谁也没有打破这份久久不散的沉默"

# game/script day13.rpy:1362
translate chinese day13_choice_4b75853b:

    # "Even the water in the bucket grows still as you stop working."
    "甚至在你停下了手里的动作时，就连桶中的水也渐渐平静下来"

# game/script day13.rpy:1366
translate chinese day13_choice_407f3d3a:

    # j "I'll figure it out."
    j "我会想出办法的"

# game/script day13.rpy:1370
translate chinese day13_choice_510b2bcb:

    # j "Eventually."
    j "迟早会的"

# game/script day13.rpy:1377
translate chinese day13_choice_4d0096e4:

    # "There may not be an 'eventually'."
    "也许根本就没有所谓的“迟早”"

# game/script day13.rpy:1379
translate chinese day13_choice_96a321de:

    # "At least not one that involves you."
    "至少不会有一个与你相关的结局"

# game/script day13.rpy:1381
translate chinese day13_choice_5bf1d41e:

    # "You hope he'll come around."
    "你希望他能回心转意"

# game/script day13.rpy:1383
translate chinese day13_choice_34c91557_1:

    # "Your lives—shared so briefly."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1385
translate chinese day13_choice_dce0db48_1:

    # "Perhaps that's all a ship like the {i}Conway{/i} is."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1387
translate chinese day13_choice_cc8f86c0_1:

    # "A place of transitions."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1389
translate chinese day13_choice_0653e54a_1:

    # "Nothing to call a home."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1391
translate chinese day13_choice_7ce94cdb_1:

    # "Just coming."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1393
translate chinese day13_choice_013a924e_1:

    # "And going."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1395
translate chinese day13_choice_47b0c23e_1:

    # "Same as those working on it."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1397
translate chinese day13_choice_49fe160e_1:

    # "With your time on this transition so agonizingly cut short."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1405
translate chinese day13_choice_89aa5b2f:

    # p "I can't do it without you."
    p "没有你我做不到"

# game/script day13.rpy:1407
translate chinese day13_choice_ff00aa44:

    # p "All of this..."
    p "这一切……"

# game/script day13.rpy:1409
translate chinese day13_choice_4df65054:

    # p "It's..."
    p "这……"

# game/script day13.rpy:1411
translate chinese day13_choice_184cb10f:

    # "You'd give anything for him to come along."
    "你愿意付出一切代价，只为让他一同而行"

# game/script day13.rpy:1413
translate chinese day13_choice_34c91557_2:

    # "Your lives—shared so briefly."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1415
translate chinese day13_choice_dce0db48_2:

    # "Perhaps that's all a ship like the {i}Conway{/i} is."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1417
translate chinese day13_choice_cc8f86c0_2:

    # "A place of transitions."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1419
translate chinese day13_choice_0653e54a_2:

    # "Nothing to call a home."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1421
translate chinese day13_choice_7ce94cdb_2:

    # "Just coming."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1423
translate chinese day13_choice_013a924e_2:

    # "And going."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1425
translate chinese day13_choice_47b0c23e_2:

    # "Same as those working on it."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1427
translate chinese day13_choice_49fe160e_2:

    # "With your time on this transition so agonizingly cut short."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1429
translate chinese day13_choice_7064461d:

    # p "Others make it look so easy."
    p "旁人总能把事情做得看起来十分容易"

# game/script day13.rpy:1431
translate chinese day13_choice_399d661a:

    # p "To be confident."
    p "如此自信"

# game/script day13.rpy:1435
translate chinese day13_choice_5fa70a6d:

    # p "But not a moment has passed since yesterday where it hasn't been on my mind."
    p "自昨天至现在，我没有一刻不在惦记着这件事"

# game/script day13.rpy:1437
translate chinese day13_choice_6a6dfb7d:

    # p "No one will be waiting for me over there and I guess it'll just be either I make it, or I'll end up starving in the streets."
    p "彼岸那边无人等候，我大概有两条路，要么闯出个头绪，要么就流落街头"

# game/script day13.rpy:1439
translate chinese day13_choice_44fdc60b:

    # j "I don't know what you want me to say, [name]."
    j "我真不知道你想让我怎么说，[family_name]"

# game/script day13.rpy:1441
translate chinese day13_choice_860326a7:

    # "His voice is firm."
    "他的声音很坚定"

# game/script day13.rpy:1445
translate chinese day13_choice_2d699ecb:

    # j "As much as I wish I did, I'm afraid I don't have a solution."
    j "我也多希望自己有办法，可实在没什么解决的法子"

# game/script day13.rpy:1449
translate chinese day13_choice_99df3505:

    # j "Perhaps it gets easier when you're on solid ground—when you can actually do something and not just wait in this wooden box."
    j "或许当你踏上坚实的地面就会好受很多，能够真正付诸行动，而不是只能困在这艘木船里静静等待"

# game/script day13.rpy:1451
translate chinese day13_choice_c443cab0_1:

    # "For a few moments neither of you break the lingering silence."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1453
translate chinese day13_choice_4b75853b_1:

    # "Even the water in the bucket grows still as you stop working."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1457
translate chinese day13_choice_e9b3f13f:

    # p "Perhaps it is. But I don't want to step on solid ground alone, Julian."
    p "也许会吧，但我不想一个人上岸，Julian"

# game/script day13.rpy:1459
translate chinese day13_choice_e3752cf4:

    # p "Us three—we've bonded, right? The new blood on board."
    p "我们三个——我们已经有了羁绊吧？都是船上的新手"

# game/script day13.rpy:1461
translate chinese day13_choice_a2b1b443:

    # p "And you've helped me so much, even in this short time.{w} I don't want to lose that."
    p "相处的日子虽短，你已经帮了我太多，{w}我不想就这么失去这份情谊"

# game/script day13.rpy:1465
translate chinese day13_choice_111d718b:

    # "He looks at the half-cleaned tool in his hands."
    "他看向手里还没擦洗完的工具"

# game/script day13.rpy:1467
translate chinese day13_choice_530d0154:

    # "His thumb slowly works a smear of tar off it."
    "他的拇指慢慢摩挲掉上面的一抹油渍"

# game/script day13.rpy:1469
translate chinese day13_choice_0bf84208:

    # j "It's not that simple."
    j "事情没那么简单"

# game/script day13.rpy:1471
translate chinese day13_choice_13c9eaf1:

    # j "You're asking me to leave everything behind."
    j "你这是在要求我抛弃一切"

# game/script day13.rpy:1478
translate chinese day13_choice_c4851e8a:

    # w "He's desperate."
    w "他很绝望"

# game/script day13.rpy:1480
translate chinese day13_choice_01e9f58f:

    # "Wolf doesn't even glance up."
    "Wolf甚至头都没抬一下"

# game/script day13.rpy:1482
translate chinese day13_choice_e9a27f10:

    # w "A lost kitten in free fall, flailing for any branch within reach."
    w "如同迷路的小猫直直下坠，慌乱扑腾着，拼命想抓住手边任何一根树枝"

# game/script day13.rpy:1484
translate chinese day13_choice_55872ec8:

    # p "I'm not desperate."
    p "我不绝望"

# game/script day13.rpy:1488
translate chinese day13_choice_599917bd_1:

    # "He closes his eyes."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1490
translate chinese day13_choice_11558317:

    # w "You {i}can{/i} be that branch. But the moment you decide you are, his whole weight falls on you."
    w "你{i}可以{/i}做那根救命的树枝，一旦你下定决心扛起这份角色，他所有的无助与重担，就都会压在你身上"

# game/script day13.rpy:1492
translate chinese day13_choice_38c2cdd8:

    # w "And a crack will see both of you plummeting."
    w "而仅仅一道裂痕就会让你们一同坠落"

# game/script day13.rpy:1494
translate chinese day13_choice_84e0c905:

    # "Wolf is the worst man to offer him that kind of advice."
    "Wolf是最不适合给他这种建议的人"

# game/script day13.rpy:1496
translate chinese day13_choice_588dd672:

    # "What would he know about it when he barely talks to a single soul?"
    "他几乎不跟任何人说话，又能懂什么呢？"

# game/script day13.rpy:1498
translate chinese day13_choice_d755e0e0:

    # "Julian looks at you with a blank expression."
    "Julian面无表情地看着你"

# game/script day13.rpy:1501
translate chinese day13_choice_2cbd3ba2:

    # "You round on Wolf, ready to defend yourself."
    "你猛地转向Wolf，随时准备为自己辩解"

# game/script day13.rpy:1505
translate chinese day13_choice_785762c5:

    # p "That's not true.{w} It won't be an issue when you have someone to trust."
    p "根本不是这样，只要有值得信任的人在身边，这一切都算不上什么难题"

# game/script day13.rpy:1507
translate chinese day13_choice_627b77ce:

    # p "If he comes, he might be that someone for me.{w} But so will I for him."
    p "倘若他愿意前来，他可以成为我的依靠，而我也会成为他可以信赖的那个人"

# game/script day13.rpy:1509
translate chinese day13_choice_33708b54:

    # w "Besides... you should know better than to talk about plans to leave around others."
    w "再说了……你心里应该有数，离开的计划千万别随便跟外人说起"

# game/script day13.rpy:1511
translate chinese day13_choice_bf3ef1ea:

    # w "They won't allow you to just walk away, Julian."
    w "他们不会就让你这么走掉的，Julian"

# game/script day13.rpy:1513
translate chinese day13_choice_feabb81f:

    # w "Might not be a navy ship, but the upper class won't like you convincing crew to jump ship."
    w "尽管这还算不上是海军舰船，但船上的长官们可绝不会喜欢你到处策反他们手下的船员出走"

# game/script day13.rpy:1515
translate chinese day13_choice_e5b5a3a2_1:

    # "You shrug him off."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1517
translate chinese day13_choice_70e3f740_1:

    # j "You don't have to tell me."
    j ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1519
translate chinese day13_choice_e3d12417:

    # p "Perhaps you're right."
    p "也许你是对的"

# game/script day13.rpy:1521
translate chinese day13_choice_9ddc7e2b:

    # p "But you're not the type to run to Mr. Hudson, Wolf."
    p "Wolf看起来也并不是会跑去向Hudson先生告密的那种人"

# game/script day13.rpy:1525
translate chinese day13_choice_88b53041:

    # w "Correct."
    w "没错"

# game/script day13.rpy:1527
translate chinese day13_choice_4a0c1463_2:

    # w "What you do is none of my business."
    w ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1529
translate chinese day13_choice_7f7bea16_2:

    # w "It was just a..."
    w ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1531
translate chinese day13_choice_0ae721fa:

    # "His eyes find Julian's briefly."
    "他的目光短暂地与Julian交汇"

# game/script day13.rpy:1535
translate chinese day13_choice_f29dfcbe_2:

    # "Wolf opens his muzzle to continue, then shakes off whatever thought it was."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1538
translate chinese day13_choice_91b422ab_2:

    # "Instead, he gets up to fetch more water."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1540
translate chinese day13_choice_c1c98dfa_2:

    # w "Never mind."
    w ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1546
translate chinese day13_choice_7701734a_2:

    # "You watch him until he disappears up the stairs."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1551
translate chinese day13_choice_8d12b606_1:

    # "Julian's hands don't stop working, but the rhythm slows."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1553
translate chinese day13_choice_353b6559_1:

    # "For a moment, you think he might say something."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1555
translate chinese day13_choice_07d97394_1:

    # "But instead, he sniffs, scratches the side of his nose, and leaves a small mark of tar."
    ""

# game/script day13.rpy:1557
translate chinese day13_choice_4e119692:

    # p "What do you sa-"
    p "那你觉得——"

# game/script day13.rpy:1561
translate chinese day13_choice_4951e99a:

    # j "I think I'll need to refresh my water, too."
    j "我想我也需要去换点水了。"

# game/script day13.rpy:1563
translate chinese day13_choice_64a09691:

    # p "That's it, then?"
    p "就没得谈了？"

# game/script day13.rpy:1565
translate chinese day13_choice_5d432956:

    # "You want to press him again, but something in the way he avoids your eyes stops you."
    "你还想再逼问几句，可他刻意避开视线的样子让你话到嘴边又咽了回去"

# game/script day13.rpy:1573
translate chinese day13_choice_520164d6:

    # "Instead, you are left to helplessly watch as he sets the tool down, presses his palms to his knees and pushes himself up."
    "你只得无助地看着他放下工具，双手撑在膝盖上，借力站起身来"

# game/script day13.rpy:1575
translate chinese day13_choice_ca704014:

    # "He passes the same benches Wolf passed earlier, the bucket weighing him down."
    "他沿着Wolf先前走过的长凳往前走，手里的木桶格外沉，压得他步履发沉"

# game/script day13.rpy:1577
translate chinese day13_choice_0802a1d8:

    # "His tail sways behind him, nearly knocking over a mug as he steadies himself."
    "身后的尾巴轻轻晃动，他刚稳住身子，尾巴差点把杯子扫翻"

# game/script day13.rpy:1579
translate chinese day13_choice_da563012:

    # "You watch him disappear down the deck with the water sloshing at his side, fighting the motion of the ship."
    "你看着他消失在甲板那头，水在他身边晃荡，与船的晃动抗争着"

# game/script day13.rpy:1581
translate chinese day13_choice_f264136b:

    # "He didn't say no."
    "他没有说不"

# game/script day13.rpy:1583
translate chinese day13_choice_5cb83613:

    # "But he didn't exactly say yes either."
    "但也没有明确说是"

# game/script day13.rpy:1585
translate chinese day13_choice_524dff96:

    # "And all you're left with is that ache in your stomach—afraid you may be leaving alone."
    "只余下心口一阵发闷的酸涩，你忍不住害怕，自己最后只能独自离开"

